<LanguageData>
    <!-- EN: Weapon Mastery -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_SettingsListItemName>Weapon Mastery</SK_WeaponMastery_SettingsListItemName>
    <!-- EN: Mod Settings:  -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionTitle>Mod设置：</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionTitle>
    <!-- EN: (Certain changes require a restart in order to take effect) -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionNote>（部分更改需要重启游戏才能生效）</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionNote>
    <!-- EN: Chance for weapon to be renamed:  -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionWeaponNameChanceLabel>殖民者为武器起昵称的几率：</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionWeaponNameChanceLabel>
    <!-- EN: On gaining the first mastery level, there's a chance for pawns to rename their weapon -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionWeaponNameChanceTooltip>在掌握了首个精通等级后，殖民者有几率为自己武器起一个与众不同的“昵称”。</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionWeaponNameChanceTooltip>
    <!-- EN: This configuration option requires Royalty DLC -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionRoyaltyRequiredLabel>需要启用皇权DLC才能更改此选项</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionRoyaltyRequiredLabel>
    <!-- EN: This configuration option requires Ideology DLC -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionIdeologyRequiredLabel>需要启用文化DLC才能更改此选项</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionIdeologyRequiredLabel>
    <!-- EN: Bonded weapon experience multiplier:  -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionBondedWeaponExperienceMultiplierLabel>绑定武器的经验获取乘数：</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionBondedWeaponExperienceMultiplierLabel>
    <!-- EN: Number of bonus stats for relic:  -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionRelicBonusStatsNumberLabel>圣物的属性加成数值：</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionRelicBonusStatsNumberLabel>
    <!-- EN: Bonuses only apply to pawns that believe in the relic's ideology -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionRelicBonusStatsNumberTooltip>只有信仰圣物对应文化形态的殖民者才能获得属性加成。</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionRelicBonusStatsNumberTooltip>
    <!-- EN: Enable Specific Mastery System -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionSpecificMasterySystemLabel>启用武器精通系统（独立）</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionSpecificMasterySystemLabel>
    <!-- EN: A pawn mastering an assault rifle will not master ALL assault rifles but only THE assault rifle that is in their possession -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionSpecificMasterySystemTooltip>举例：殖民者只能精通使用自己手中的突击步枪，而不是所有的突击步枪。</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionSpecificMasterySystemTooltip>
    <!-- EN: Enable General Mastery System -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionGeneralMasterySystemLabel>启用武器精通系统（共通）</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionGeneralMasterySystemLabel>
    <!-- EN: A pawn mastering an assault rifle will master ALL assault rifles NOT only the assault rifle that is in their possession -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionGeneralMasterySystemTooltip>举例：殖民者可以精通使用所有的突击步枪，而不仅仅是自己手中的突击步枪。</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionGeneralMasterySystemTooltip>
    <!-- EN: Masteries on outsider pawns -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryOutsiderPawnsLabel>武器精通系统是否对殖民者以外的单位生效</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryOutsiderPawnsLabel>
    <!-- EN: Allow masteries to spawn on pawns coming from outside your colony. Such as raids, visitors and traders. -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryOutsiderTooltip>允许武器精通系统对殖民者以外的单位生效，比如袭击者、访客或商队。</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryOutsiderTooltip>
    <!-- EN: Display Experience -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionDisplayExperienceLabel>显示经验槽</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionDisplayExperienceLabel>
    <!-- EN: Display experience needed to level up for each weapon in the info tab -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionDisplayExperienceTooltip>在武器的“描述”界面中显示等级经验槽</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionDisplayExperienceTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Keep Original Name and Quality -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionKeepOriginalNameAndQualityLabel>保留武器原本显示的名字与品质</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionKeepOriginalNameAndQualityLabel>
  <!-- EN: When a weapon name is generated, the mod will keep the original weapon's name and quality in the generated name. Example: "Boomer" Revolver (normal). Do keep in mind this might make certain weapon names too long to be fully displayed. -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionKeepOriginalNameAndQualityTooltip>当一把武器生成了昵称后，原本显示的名字和品质将会继续保留。具体格式为：“粉红毛兔兔”左轮手枪（一般）。请注意，这可能会导致某些武器的名字因过长而无法完全显示。</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionKeepOriginalNameAndQualityTooltip>
    <!-- EN: Percentage of pawns that should spawn with a mastery from a group -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryGroupPercentage>NPC团体在生成时出现武器精通者的几率</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryGroupPercentage>
    <!-- EN: Weapon name chance per pawn -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryWeaponNameChancePerPawn>每个殖民者为武器起昵称的几率</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsSectionMasteryWeaponNameChancePerPawn>
    <!-- EN: Weapon mood buff/debuff -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsUseMoodsCheckboxLabel>武器心情增益/减益</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsUseMoodsCheckboxLabel>
    <!-- EN: When equipping a mastered weapon, pawn gains a mood bonus and vice versa (Specific Weapon Mastery Only) -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsUseMoodsCheckboxTooltip>当装备了已精通武器时，殖民者将会获得一个额外的心情增益，反之亦然。只在“武器精通系统（独立）”下生效。</SK_WeaponMastery_ModSettingsUseMoodsCheckboxTooltip>
    <!-- EN: Levels Section:  -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionTitle>精通等级设置：</SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionTitle>
    <!-- EN: Add or remove mastery levels up to a max of 15 levels. Each time a pawn levels up, they will get a random stat bonus. -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionDetail>你可以在这里添加新的或删除原有的精通等级。最大上限为15级。每次升级后，殖民者使用已精通的武器时就会随机获得一项额外的属性加成。你可以在武器的“描述”界面中查看已获得的属性加成。</SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionDetail>
    <!-- EN: Add Level -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionAddButton>添加精通等级</SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionAddButton>
    <!-- EN: Remove Level -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionRemoveButton>移除精通等级</SK_WeaponMastery_LevelSectionRemoveButton>
