  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionDisableButton>禁用此项属性</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionDisableButton>
    <!-- EN: Warning: Only certain stat defs are applicable to weapons and pawns, the rest are just ignored. If you don't know what you're doing, I would highly recommend not editing anything in this section. -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionWarning>警告：只有某些属性加成对武器和殖民者有效。无法生效的属性会被自动忽略掉。由于这里引用的是无法被翻译的属性代码，如果你实在看不懂的话，就不要随便乱动了。</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionWarning>
    <!-- EN: Note: Percentage stats use values from 0 -> 1 which maps to 0% -> 100% -->
  <SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionNote>（举例：0.35对应35%，1对应100%）</SK_WeaponMastery_RangedAndMeleeStatsSectionNote>
